{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "43c6cc99dd50bcb2c21558e487d42d8a2adf217a297612a0024f51ea0f86fc62", "ja": "（今日は杏奈の宣材写真を撮りに来た。そろそろ\n撮影が始まるけど、杏奈の調子はどうだろうか？）", "zh": "（今天要来拍杏奈的宣传照。\n差不多要开拍了，不知道杏奈的状况如何？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "25c7491677e7b04b5d217862454fef9a218e76d01cfb5c2dce674d694c2594a6", "ja": "スタッフさん達、初めまして！\n望月杏奈です♪", "zh": "工作人员你们好，初次见面！\n我是望月杏奈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
