{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "9352cb3174c95590c6e68b14319ff745cfc4bc750cd2d4b1ebad3ae22280c0c6", "ja": "撮影のお仕事は初めてですけど、ビビッと頑張ります！\n今日はよろしくお願いしま～す！", "zh": "虽然是第一次做拍照的工作，\n但杏奈会充满活力地加油！今天请多多指教～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1004_camman", "source_sha256": "9bb6b64de4fe2e40573b5b07fee8d354032f6d30ce840946c56c24d4ae2c394b", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。望月さんは、とっても\n元気だから、楽しい撮影になりそうですね。", "zh": "请多多指教。望月小姐这么有活力，\n看来今天会拍得很开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "661aac0296f95cd793b257f7a3ed8c944582f9dffbe1f9cceb57d6df15d1dd3d", "ja": "（スタジオの空気が一気に明るくなった！　カメラマン\nさんの言う通り、きっといい撮影になるな！）", "zh": "（摄影棚内的气氛一下就开朗起来了！\n如摄影师所说，今天一定会拍得很好的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa24282fec0f37c57eaeb5cab24e038c642a584412cea36b592789cc8b327aee", "ja": "いっえ～い！\nビビッとキメちゃうよ！", "zh": "耶～！\n那就充满活力地摆出姿势啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1007_camman", "source_sha256": "9780da09acd70d0d0e4b1f8c32e64babbdfc4be62b5ea812819e95c7e15074df", "ja": "その表情いいですね！　\n望月さん、次は別のポーズでも撮ってみましょう。", "zh": "那个表情很棒！\n望月小姐，接着来拍拍看其他姿势吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "269cd06904de638631594e976bd12ba957e11d5360e3f20962bde17a56cd0dcf", "ja": "了解でーす！\nじゃあ、気合いを入れて……。", "zh": "明白──！\n那就打起精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "c321bf25e6c8c83151d049cfe0c723c69ad9d25611ab8943e6413351b1fce4a3", "ja": "やっほ～♪\n杏奈、絶好調だよっ！！", "zh": "嗨～♪\n杏奈，状况超棒！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1010_camman", "source_sha256": "26289d080e91cd2ea43ab70be2ca36358f3ef4a45ea99fd2c3db136aa0ff0247", "ja": "いいですね！　もう一枚撮らせてください。\nデビュー前だなんて思えないわ！", "zh": "很赞喔！再让我拍一张。\n根本不像还没出道的新人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "7adbaacec543ba7749fbcddec9fa032939a161c5abef217f3da040cc2afefaee", "ja": "ありがとー！\n杏奈、もっともーっと頑張るね！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "谢谢──！\n杏奈会更加更～加努力的！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2f98ab248233eb70c876e67fd2894a9ab20d1e7de545956d2f01dbdf0d3f9910", "ja": "（その後、まるでスタジオがステージになったかのよう\nに、杏奈は次々とポーズを決め、撮影が終わった）", "zh": "（那之后，整个摄影棚仿佛摇身变为舞台，\n杏奈接连地摆出姿势，顺利完成拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "f9ba7f70b615aae6ab36235a1c94e726cac49cff63d8bff83324903cc89a89b8", "ja": "杏奈、すごくよかったぞ！　カメラマンさんも\nまた一緒に仕事がしたいって言ってたし……。", "zh": "杏奈，你很棒喔！\n摄影师也说还想再跟你一起工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e048033c6fdda09e813e9e1829ac424573d1a67332e4f214d3b01b267f68066e", "ja": "あ、あれ……？", "zh": "奇、奇怪了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "33163e9c20e8c2508b52c5920337a8aa6ebb745bdbb86122ebe75e464ab616c5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n杏奈……楽しかった……です……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n杏奈……很……开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "353efb5c585d8e771e02be83cbc98f1011a429f6ef05de00e67521b3a78375b6", "ja": "憧れのアイドルに……本当に、なれて……\nうれしくて……ずっとフワフワ、してた……の……。", "zh": "真的能……成为向往的，偶像……\n杏奈很高兴……一直，感觉轻飘飘……的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "6cbb3aebc495878bf177bef7e92b0cf68920639f6dac5bd6a6fb930a382e0b33", "ja": "ん……杏奈……体力、ないから……眠くなって……。\nもしかして……今までの、全部……夢……？", "zh": "嗯……杏奈……体力，不好……所以困了……\n该不会……之前那些，全都是……在作梦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ebfd9de2ece7557f4216be5a5a8428fceb090c4ecb56aa2e7429936994b6c390", "ja": "いや、夢じゃないぞ。杏奈はアイドルで今日、最高の\n撮影をしたんだ。眠くなるまで、よく頑張ったな。", "zh": "不，不是梦。杏奈是偶像，而且今天拍出了\n最棒的照片。你都累到发困了，做得很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "e45a18722b43bc7cb039a640be764c7a24833a43cf941d15d69aa3b947367945", "ja": "ん……ありが、とう……。", "zh": "嗯……谢谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "d38279cc77668a7498391f6c35087a6c1f4130d1d379d265a015f5bf1a39357c", "ja": "{$P$}さん……事務所に戻ったら……\n一緒にゲーム……しよ……ね……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……回事务所之后……\n一起……玩游戏……吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e3078cd858654fd03f86911e03cfc23c93324677d5cbfa3b6491b319bc78701a", "ja": "（宣材に写っているのは、未来のトップアイドルの姿。\nいつか本当の大舞台で、もう一度……！）", "zh": "（宣传照上拍出的，是未来顶尖偶像的身影。\n总有一天她会在真正的大舞台上再次发光发热……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
